{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic beat 'em up with dynamic combat \u2013 mix up your moves, use the environment, and choose your own fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggy the frog was living a peaceful life in his cozy swamp with his beloved Chika\u2026 until one day, she was taken by mysterious forces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/c6bb7fbe95c55ffb76a0bee98d0b0032.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Froggy has to go on a dangerous journey full of strange enemies and deadly traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/2801fe4ae3daa93a1b283cc70538cb27.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=264 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fun and action-packed beat 'em up, you\u2019ll fight your way through waves of weird enemies \u2013 angry cardboard boxes, wild mailboxes, sneaky trash bags, and even some suspicious tin cans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/c826a732c90630f499265ba91171faba.poster.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/c826a732c90630f499265ba91171faba.webm?t=1757099804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/5a800b138c06158d7b64026024b0426a.poster.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/5a800b138c06158d7b64026024b0426a.webm?t=1757099804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your punches, combos, and agility to get through it all and save Chika!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/e859309e17e72e04348f7c4f2934d6ba.poster.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/e859309e17e72e04348f7c4f2934d6ba.webm?t=1757099804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FETURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced gameplay:</strong> you\u2019ll need to make quick decisions and pull off combos of varying complexity to gain the upper hand in battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo system:</strong> Froggy\u2019s arsenal includes two variations of punch combos, several special moves, and one ultimate ability. When combined with wall interactions, you can unleash incredible strings that leave enemies no chance to fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control features:</strong> the game offers four action buttons (punch, jump, special move, ultimate) and classic D-pad controls, which you can remap at any time to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your perfect style:</strong> once you get a feel for the moves and their timing, you\u2019ll be able to master powerful, perfectly executed combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics settings:</strong> you can cap your FPS at popular refresh rates and enable VSync for smoother visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training mode:</strong> practice your attacks and combos in a dedicated dojo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3487760?t=1757099804","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/e471d33685a37a5fb4986d7a848716e9fcd456ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757099804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/9b8b5c20323d96446ca6c2e32c7822e235673e12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757099804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/9b8b5c20323d96446ca6c2e32c7822e235673e12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757099804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon-style violence between fictional characters. No realistic violence, gore, or sensitive topics are present."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic beat 'em up with dynamic combat \u2013 mix up your moves, use the environment, and choose your own fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Froggy the frog was living a peaceful life in his cozy swamp with his beloved Chika\u2026 until one day, she was taken by mysterious forces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"b