bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/e859309e17e72e04348f7c4f2934d6ba.poster.avif?t=1757099804\" width=600 height=267 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487760/extras/e859309e17e72e04348f7c4f2934d6ba.webm?t=1757099804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">FETURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced gameplay:</strong> you\u2019ll need to make quick decisions and pull off combos of varying complexity to gain the upper hand in battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo system:</strong> Froggy\u2019s arsenal includes two variations of punch combos, several special moves, and one ultimate ability. When combined with wall interactions, you can unleash incredible strings that leave enemies no chance to fight back.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control features:</strong> the game offers four action buttons (punch, jump, special move, ultimate) and classic D-pad controls, which you can remap at any time to suit your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your perfect style:</strong> once you get a feel for the moves and their timing, you\u2019ll be able to master powerful, perfectly executed combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics settings:</strong> you can cap your FPS at popular refresh rates and enable VSync for smoother visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training mode:</strong> practice your attacks and combos in a dedicated dojo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["CoJIRpa"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"2